# Filled-in copies of the shipped *.example.* templates (channels.json,
# labels.json, routing-table.md, alerts.md) carry real channel ids, alert ids,
# service names and label maps. They live in your own repository or under
# ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DATA}, never in this tree, so nothing here needs ignoring.

